      "writtenOn": "2024-05-30T19:27:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we can do this. Besides having the overhead of copying all sampler descs for every texture into `cumulativeSamplerData`, that is then always being added to the key.\n\nThe regular samplers shouldn\u0027t be part of the PaintParamsKey or we will trigger more pipeline compiles than actually necessary. \n\nIn the common case where we never encounter an immutable sampler, we should never append more data to `cumulativeSamplerData` and then never add anything to the paint key either.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 353,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 353,
        "endChar": 64
      },
      "fixSuggestions": [
        {
          "fixId": "0bf9ecaf_e04990f6",
          "description": "prompt_to_edit API",
          "replacements": [
            {
              "path": "src/gpu/graphite/PaintParams.cpp",
              "range": {
                "startLine": 348,
                "startChar": 0,
                "endLine": 363,
                "endChar": 0
              },
              "replacement": "            cumulativeSamplerData.push_back(samplerDesc.desc() \u003e\u003e\n                                             SamplerDesc::kImmutableSamplerInfoShift);\n            cumulativeSamplerData.push_back(samplerDesc.externalFormatMSBs());\n"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "revId": "fef4d262c7142bb2db5dfd1664dbaccad1643f68",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
